ck or mineral or  origin of a planet  it was an incredible integrated effort  where  you had scientists and engineers  the astronauts with their technical  training  but also their ability to fly these  incredible spacecraft  and it was an integrated approach that  also  showed that science is not just about  physics or just about chemistry  or just about biology and geology but  you have to understand  all of these fields together to  understand the evolution the origin  of planets of moons that's an incredibly  important insight that's true  today as well  [Music]  you
 

